{:edb/db-before-t 668 :edb/db-after-t 669 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533981 50 #inst "2026-10-05T23:47:18.824Z" 13194139533981 true] [17592186068613 1020 #edb/ref 17592186275711 13194139533981 true] [17592186068613 1020 #edb/ref 17592186275718 13194139533981 true] [17592186068614 1020 #edb/ref 17592186275728 13194139533981 true] [17592186068615 1020 #edb/ref 17592186275704 13194139533981 true] [17592186068615 1020 #edb/ref 17592186275721 13194139533981 true] [17592186275704 1017 #edb/ref 17592186275705 13194139533981 true] [17592186275704 1089 "q-115530" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275704 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533981 true] [17592186275704 1100 "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{{ln}^{2}⁡x}.$" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275704 1113 #uuid "1c16c119-1378-5409-b295-b09c8e50af75" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275704 1145 "Here the limits of the numerator and denominator are ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\sqrt{x}=\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }{ln}^{2}⁡x=\\infty ,$ respectively, so we have the case $\\frac{\\infty }{\\infty }.$\n\nApplying L'Hopital's rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{{ln}^{2}⁡x} & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{[\\sqrt{x}]^{′}}{{[{ln}^{2}⁡x]}^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}})}{(\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{x}{4\\sqrt{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe resulting limit still gives the indeterminate form $\\frac{\\infty }{\\infty }.$ To find the limit, we apply L'Hopital's rule once again. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{{ln}^{2}⁡x} & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{[\\sqrt{x}]^{′}}{[4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x]^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}})}{(\\frac{4}{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{x}{8\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\sqrt{x} \\\\  & =\\infty .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275706 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275707 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275708 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275709 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275710 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1041 "selection" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275707 13194139533981 true] [17592186275705 1110 #uuid "7e5faff8-f4dc-5206-83e4-4a1fbb981af5" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275706 1034 "\\frac{1}{8}" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275706 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275706 1111 #uuid "33ffd934-5f64-58c1-bfa8-cf43ec6a7b06" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275707 1034 "\\infty " 13194139533981 true] [17592186275707 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275707 1111 #uuid "b29bb4de-e2e0-56ba-9282-b1fdfe9636df" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275708 1034 "-\\infty " 13194139533981 true] [17592186275708 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275708 1111 #uuid "0768e085-457d-5566-8f90-19a74d61576f" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275709 1034 "1" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275709 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275709 1111 #uuid "f2e3162a-4e7a-5564-9884-12464ab6d7b9" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275710 1034 "0" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275710 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275710 1111 #uuid "90c1c08b-70e3-5e52-9c96-014e226f89a3" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275711 1017 #edb/ref 17592186275712 13194139533981 true] [17592186275711 1089 "q-31585" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275711 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533981 true] [17592186275711 1100 "${lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{e}^{x}-x-1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-1}=$" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275711 1113 #uuid "b1e8835d-2849-5c15-b2b3-5060e0821698" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275711 1145 "If we plug in $x=0$ we get the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0},$ so  we apply L'Hopital's rule to find the limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{e}^{x}-x-1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-1} & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{[{e}^{x}-x-1]^{′}}{[\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-1]^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{e}^{x}-1}{-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{e}^{x}-1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis time, the resulting limit still gives the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0}.$ To find the limit, we apply L'Hopital's rule once again. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{e}^{x}-x-1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-1} & =-{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{e}^{x}-1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{[{e}^{x}-1]^{′}}{[\\operatorname{sin}⁡x]^{′}} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{e}^{x}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{e}^{0}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡0} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{1} \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275713 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275714 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275715 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275716 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275717 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1041 "selection" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275716 13194139533981 true] [17592186275712 1110 #uuid "d3289c5e-cad9-5a38-9f0d-b79099f92a16" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275713 1034 "\\infty " 13194139533981 true] [17592186275713 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275713 1111 #uuid "02299284-7905-5e23-a99b-fab257fad339" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275714 1034 "1" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275714 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275714 1111 #uuid "45f7f7ff-fa85-556d-ac9b-fb6cf116a017" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275715 1034 "0" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275715 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275715 1111 #uuid "96b91ed0-23a5-5a64-b958-be50242ffb32" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275716 1034 "-1" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275716 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275716 1111 #uuid "19d23dce-89ec-5bf3-8b43-cb25fdebb900" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275717 1034 "-2" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275717 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275717 1111 #uuid "29f955b3-1f9d-5ebc-9826-4d116af6cf84" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275718 1017 #edb/ref 17592186275719 13194139533981 true] [17592186275718 1089 "q-336935" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275718 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533981 true] [17592186275718 1100 "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n$\\,{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{ln\\,(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275718 1113 #uuid "f06dd217-55b8-5f77-84e6-dcab94f6c615" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275718 1145 "If we plug in $x=0$ we get the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0},$ so  we apply L'Hopital's rule to find the limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{ln\\,(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)} & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{[ln\\,(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)]}^{′}}{[1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)]^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))}{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)}{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis time, the resulting limit still gives the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0}.$ To find the limit, we apply L'Hopital's rule once again. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{ln\\,(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)} & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)}{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{[\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)]}^{′}}{{[(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)]}^{′}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)}{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+3(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275719 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275720 13194139533981 true] [17592186275719 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533981 true] [17592186275719 1041 "field-1" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275719 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275720 13194139533981 true] [17592186275719 1110 #uuid "6692dc66-2864-55c0-918e-b77305481098" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275720 1034 "-\\frac{4}{9}" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275720 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275720 1111 #uuid "b5df862c-e599-5956-bcd4-c6e6ea300a52" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275721 1017 #edb/ref 17592186275722 13194139533981 true] [17592186275721 1089 "q-3778" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275721 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533981 true] [17592186275721 1100 "${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{{x}^{2}-1}{x+16}=$" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275721 1113 #uuid "e565d8e2-3b12-5048-98de-b990b804380c" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275721 1145 "In this case, we have an indeterminate form of type $\\frac{\\infty }{\\infty },$ so applying  L'Hopital's rule yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{{x}^{2}-1}{x+16} & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{[{x}^{2}-1]^{′}}{[x+16]^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{2x}{1} \\\\  & =-\\infty .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275723 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275724 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275725 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275726 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275727 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1041 "selection" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275724 13194139533981 true] [17592186275722 1110 #uuid "fb670e21-a172-5934-91ac-63ce37493d5f" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275723 1034 "\\infty " 13194139533981 true] [17592186275723 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275723 1111 #uuid "89e58617-4349-519b-803a-00f0feaf28dc" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275724 1034 "-\\infty " 13194139533981 true] [17592186275724 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275724 1111 #uuid "57d362d0-f1da-5400-9004-ee0218c88d87" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275725 1034 "1" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275725 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275725 1111 #uuid "9228ff48-7005-5a36-be2b-4de15ca746f8" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275726 1034 "0" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275726 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275726 1111 #uuid "3f4d198e-b15b-5662-9110-b93ba3a9eba6" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275727 1034 "\\frac{1}{16}" 13194139533981 true] [17592186275727 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533981 true] [17592186275727 1111 #uuid "79444b30-53a2-5fa7-871a-c6436654074e" 1319413